dateModified: "2026-10-14"
bodyClass: page--light-nav page--pink-cta
globalPage: true
globalFaq:
  - question: "Can I use Zennly outside Nepal?"
    answer: "Yes, on request. Zennly is Nepal-first and web-based, so it runs in any browser. We set it up for service businesses in other countries, including the USA, UK, Canada, Australia and the UAE. Book a demo and tell us your country and number of branches."
  - question: "What is the best multi-branch spa and salon management software?"
    answer: "It depends on whether you run one location or several. Zennly is built for multi-branch service businesses. It locks each appointment to a branch, room and staff member so double bookings cannot happen, requires manager approval for discounts, records payments by method and reconciles each day across every branch."
  - question: "Does Zennly work for spas, salons, gyms and clinics in any country?"
    answer: "The booking, staff scheduling, discount approval and daily reconciliation workflow is the same in any country. It fits spas, salons, barbershops, gyms, physiotherapy and beauty clinics, tattoo studios and cleaning companies."
  - question: "Do I need to install anything?"
    answer: "No. Zennly runs in the browser on a phone, tablet or computer, and customers book from a web page, so there is no app to download."
  - question: "Who built Zennly?"
    answer: "Zennly is built by Zunkireelabs, founded in 2018 in Lalitpur, Nepal. Its first live client, Nuad Thai Spa Kathmandu, runs four branches, 39 therapists and 194 services on it."
  - question: "How much does Zennly cost?"
    answer: "Zennly is quoted per business, based on branches, team size and features. Book a 20-minute demo and you receive a tailored quote within 24 hours."
